  "body": "Almost all the users of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#remove-an-element-from-a-document, including at least:\r\n\r\n * https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-iframe-element:remove-an-element-from-a-document\r\n * https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#playing-the-media-resource:remove-an-element-from-a-document\r\n\r\n(And https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#association-of-controls-and-forms:remove-an-element-from-a-document at least too)\r\n\r\nShould probably use the \"becomes disconnected\" concept to be shadow-dom aware.",
